abstract: >-
  AASF-BSOP Diffusion Policy provides the research implementation and
  reproducibility materials developed on top of the upstream Diffusion Policy
  codebase, including adaptive action smoothing, boundary-safe overlap
  projection, baseline comparisons, cross-condition analyses, simulated Franka
  dynamics replay, and a teacher-forced SO-101 held-out trajectory audit.

keywords:
  - "diffusion policy"
  - "robot learning"
  - "visuomotor policy"
  - "action smoothness"
  - "boundary-safe overlap projection"
  - "trajectory control"
